          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasarmasa Musa sea fuga Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA, nea geeyi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sarmeeda Miriyamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba faraasajeega Farao ea mutukwajeagaaschi ea fugaaschi ding'da faraasajeega hean nea gaweay jeeda basooda, ng'ata ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA gabiiksiinyi beega, nea fuga Israeli gaweay aba bugusta basooda nea gwasik heeda ghajaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Miriyamueeda was sibaneeda bea geenyea Haruni, hean gawa nea ghwaada geat bundiida, hean ghaat geeshta gadeemga sean nea gaba siisi mideawa bundiida, gaweay nea ghang'was. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasarmasa Miriyamu saawa nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beega ng'weani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadoabiiw Musa fuga Israeli gaweay mwadi nea ghang'eada basooda Shaamu, ea ghwahita jeeda dareapcheeda Shuri, ak gaweay eawooji samwagu aba jeeda dareapcheeda nea meanyasa beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geehita hiji siguura Meara, ea mudeali beega Meara aba gideaba ea ng'wean, hean ghoah gisibaysiina eeguura gheawungaaschi Meara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooniiksa buuneeda Musa nea geeyeesha, “Gajealeaha naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooyeawusa Musa NG'UTAMIIDA, ak goohiimsa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa geeta, ak gageanu ghoabuuta jeedeaba beegiga, hean gwanyeaniidi beega, ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA diigheanda, nea goorgweaksa nea ghoanaal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayeesha, “Inyas giileeysiit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak gisini ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda gheanyangaaschi, nea giileeysiit giirukuneey, nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi sean, abeeda maydanung' ghoang'waanyi geeyooda wassean ghayi aang'udi fuga Misri aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA aheapeey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
